---
source: crates/skif-edit/tests/package_json_format.rs
expression: "report(\"shorthands\")"
---
issues:
  - `bugs` can be written as its URL
  - `repository` can be written as its shorthand
--- before
{
  "name": "shorthands",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/acme/repo/issues"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/acme/repo.git"
  }
}
--- after
{
  "name": "shorthands",
  "bugs": "https://github.com/acme/repo/issues",
  "repository": "acme/repo.git"
}
